  "title": "Cannoli",
  "description": "Make cannoli with this foolproof recipe with clear instructions and lots of tips to help you recreate the delicious cannoli you get in Italian bakeries.",
  "authors": [
    "Lydia Nacawa"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:12:30-04:00",
